# ShellCheck configuration for crosscodex
# Disable note-level style suggestions that don't affect correctness

# SC2292: Prefer [[ ]] over [ ] - [ ] works fine in POSIX sh
# SC2310: Function in condition disables set -e - acceptable pattern
# SC2249: Missing default case in switch - not always necessary
# SC2312: Command in substitution masks return - acceptable for non-critical commands
disable=SC2292,SC2310,SC2249,SC2312
